 Q1","e":"njr","d":"2020-02-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Richard J. Ciciarelli","x":"So just reaffirming the guidance, but not necessarily trending higher or lower.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/new-jersey-resources-corp-njr-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NJR 2020 Q3","e":"njr","d":"2020-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Westhoven","x":"And in summary, despite a difficult environment, the strength of our diversified businesses has allowed us to reaffirm guidance, maintain our capital programs and continue to provide uninterrupted service to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/new-jersey-resources-corp-njr-q3-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NJR 2020 Q4","e":"njr","d":"2020-11-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy F. Shea","x":"Moving forward NJR ES sees several key strategic opportunities emerging energy landscape with increased cost cutting, efficiencies, consolidation and growing financial pressures on producers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/30/new-jersey-resources-corp-njr-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NJR 2021 Q2","e":"njr","d":"2021-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Westhoven","x":"The overperformance from Energy Services allowed us to increase our guidance for the fiscal year and provides the flexibility to reinvest in our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/new-jersey-resources-corp-njr-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"NJR 2021 Q3","e":"njr","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gabe Moreen","x":"Whether it's right basing your own investments, or being able to pass through RNG costs or costs of gas to customers and how to recover those costs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/new-jersey-resources-corporation-njr-q3-2021-earni/"},{"c":"NJR 2021 Q4","e":"njr","d":"2021-11-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick Migliaccio","x":"As a reminder, the cost of natural gas supply for NJNG's pass-through to our customers to mitigate the risk of sudden and dramatic price changes, NJNG S&T [Phonetic] program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/18/new-jersey-resources-corporation-njr-q4-2021-earni/"},{"c":"NJR 2021 Q4","e":"njr","d":"2021-11-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Westhoven","x":"This allows us to raise guidance 3 times during the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/18/new-jersey-resources-corporation-njr-q4-2021-earni/"},{"c":"NJR 2025 Q3","e":"njr","d":"2025-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Westhoven","x":"We'll have to update tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/njr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NJR 2026 Q1","e":"njr","d":"2026-02-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Westhoven","x":"This represents the sixth consecutive year of raising guidance as a result of the strength of our complementary portfolio of businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/new-jersey-resources-njr-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NJR 2026 Q2","e":"njr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Westhoven","x":"Each year, we secure a significant portion of winter gas supply well advanced, limiting our customers' exposure to sharp commodity price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/njr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NJR 2026 Q2","e":"njr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Westhoven","x":"During our prior conference call, we raised our guidance by $0.25 per share, driven by Energy Service outperformance in January 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/njr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NJR 2026 Q2","e":"njr","d":"